From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:42:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Tune gfx90a Qwen block FP8 GEMMs

- Add a conservative gfx90a family default.
- Tune four Qwen 3 4B decode projections.
- Raise model throughput from 4.49 to 33.88.
- Validate tiles against the Torch reference.

Tools used:
- GPT-5.6 Sol: GPT-5.6 Sol

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
---
